echcrunch.com/2019/04/28/2019-04-26-elon-musk-sec-agree-to-guidelines-on-twitter-use/|https://jp.techcrunch.com/2019/04/28/2019-04-26-elon-musk-sec-agree-to-guidelines-on-twitter-use/\u003e\n最近それが形骸化してきたという指摘は当然でてます","ts":"1620895448.214100","attachments":[{"fallback":"TechCrunch Japan: マスク氏のツイートを弁護士が監督することでSECと和解 | TechCrunch Japan","id":1,"title":"マスク氏のツイートを弁護士が監督することでSECと和解 | TechCrunch Japan","title_link":"https://jp.techcrunch.com/2019/04/28/2019-04-26-elon-musk-sec-agree-to-guidelines-on-twitter-use/","text":"テスラのイーロン・マスク氏、そして米国証券取引委員会（SEC）は4月26日、マスク氏のツイート問題で合意に達したと発表した。","image_url":"https://jp.techcrunch.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/04/musk.jpeg?w=1024","blocks":null,"service_name":"TechCrunch Japan","service_icon":"https://jp.techcrunch.com/wp-content/themes/techcrunch-jp-2015/assets/images/TC_favicon.png","from_url":"https://jp.techcrunch.com/2019/04/28/2019-04-26-elon-musk-sec-agree-to-guidelines-on-twitter-use/","original_url":"https://jp.techcrunch.com/2019/04/28/2019-04-26-elon-musk-sec-agree-to-guidelines-on-twitter-use/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8Xx="}]},{"client_msg_id":"30e94f27-c58c-4514-823a-e2a009ae1126","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"価格はすでにそれを反映していると考えている","ts":"1620895429.213200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U7B4ZD49X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"R8dR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aa20d2f8-2791-40ea-bf7a-b581d8f250d1","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"短期取引においてはそういう細かいところはたいていやられており","ts":"1620895416.212600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/JfR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d407253a-71aa-476e-aa9f-d4feb8002fe6","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"\u003chttps://www.itmedia.co.jp/news/articles/2003/04/news013.html\u003e","ts":"1620895351.210900","attachments":[{"fall