0026amp;utm_content=japan\u0026amp;utm_campaign=socialflow-organic\u003e","ts":"1620880873.201600","attachments":[{"fallback":"Bloomberg.com: ビットコイン急落、５万ドル割れ－テスラ車購入での利用停止受け","id":1,"title":"ビットコイン急落、５万ドル割れ－テスラ車購入での利用停止受け","title_link":"https://www.bloomberg.co.jp/news/articles/2021-05-13/QT0OFYDWLU6801?utm_source=twitter\u0026utm_medium=social\u0026cmpid%3D=socialflow-twitter-japan\u0026utm_content=japan\u0026utm_campaign=socialflow-organic","text":"ビットコイン価格はアジア時間13日午前の取引で一時15％の急落となり、５万ドルを割り込んだ。米テスラのイーロン・マスク最高経営責任者（ＣＥＯ）が12日、ツイッターに投稿した発表文で、同社が仮想通貨ビットコインを利用した車購入を停止したことを明らかにした。","image_url":"https://assets.bwbx.io/images/users/iqjWHBFdfxIU/iYdkwgcDRmb4/v1/1200x800.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"Bloomberg.com","service_icon":"https://assets.bwbx.io/s3/javelin/public/javelin/images/favicon-black-63fe5249d3.png","from_url":"https://www.bloomberg.co.jp/news/articles/2021-05-13/QT0OFYDWLU6801?utm_source=twitter\u0026utm_medium=social\u0026cmpid%3D=socialflow-twitter-japan\u0026utm_content=japan\u0026utm_campaign=socialflow-organic","original_url":"https://www.bloomberg.co.jp/news/articles/2021-05-13/QT0OFYDWLU6801?utm_source=twitter\u0026amp;utm_medium=social\u0026amp;cmpid%3D=socialflow-twitter-japan\u0026amp;utm_content=japan\u0026amp;utm_campaign=socialflow-organic"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dg/uM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9aab173a-772f-4459-abd6-581304c1d590","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":":bitcoi-n: :chart_with_downwards_trend: :question:","ts":"1620880857.201400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pV1A"}]},{"client_msg_id":"26ff303f-c55b-4946-be61-435267105554","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"今となっては Kyash を使う理由は私にはなくなっちゃったな。残高がまだ残ってるのでこれなんとか使い切ったら休眠だなぁ。一応人から受け取る口として残すだけ残しておくけど","ts":"1620876899.200900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Alkfb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"223784ed-de66-4ff2-8d70-fc5cad43dd4e","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ただ、まだ自分にはそこそこフィットするので使いつづけてる","ts":"1620876279.199900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WICA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dd4861e3-43a1-4bc6-a7c4-9a32fd35676f","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"とにかく使ってくれだったのはわかるけど、将来展望とか方向性が見えにくかったから、単純プロキシ感あったからねー。","ts":"1620876245.199500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WCC3t"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1b0f14d0-dcd3-4d1c-ac92-f2c8c3d9a7ee","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"最初から決済用のプロキシカードではなかったっていうのは今からすると腑に落ちますね\n最初の高還元を受けてた側からすると納得できなかった感じしますけど","ts":"1620876213.199000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"i6AON"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9f445f0e-f9df-4370-8f44-ba27a4421e6a","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"なお、最近は共有口座なるものができた \u0026gt; Kyash\n俺達としては違うけど、意味とか意義はわかるので、なるほど目的がちがったんだよねと","ts":"1620876107.197400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+RYyA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d5e718da-0185-4c76-badd-1b649b48a23b","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"普通にVisaプリペイドとしても使えますし","ts":"1620875989.196700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"b9FFk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"989b3f7a-aa75-4efa-b006-9da0f942af2c","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"単純に還元ですね\n他の機能も今のKyashと同水準っぽくはあるのでもうKyashは完全にお役御免になるかなと","ts":"1620875962.196200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cbDf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7cfa30a8-1aa4-4e2f-b160-27b6c6d5a686","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"Kyash はプリペイドだし個人間送金が一応ウリらしい(?)けど、どの辺りの機能が代わりになりそうです? 純粋に還元率?","ts":"1620875871.194500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cvKa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5cc0527a-2f13-473f-8900-e48f017da18b","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"Kyashの代わりを期待してる","ts":"1620875749.193500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Pnx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dacc0236-4db3-4cfa-b8ec-ce09690fa1e7","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"三井住友VISAカードとLINE Pay連携でLINE Payクレカ相当の還元貰えるらしいので登録した","ts":"1620875730.193200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xK20g"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UM8QP0FFF","text":"\u003c@UM8QP0FFF\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1620865546.192500","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null}]
